# libmach arm64 (aarch64) support vendored from 9front
# (https://github.com/9front/9front @ 350266104f1fed81c78c3d05fa44f523bec0ae4d,
# branch "front", 2026-10-31).
#
# Imported files:
#   7.c      arm64 Mach register/stack description (marm64)
#   7db.c    arm64 disassembler/debugger support (arm64mach)
#   7obj.c   7-format object parser (_is7/_read7)
#
# Local modifications vs upstream:
#   * 7.c — the single path rewrite of the import set:
#     #include "/arm64/include/ureg.h" becomes "/aarch64/include/ureg.h"
#     (project naming is aarch64; D-11 rename-on-import covers tree paths).
#   * libmach-internal arch names are NOT renamed: the setmach entry string
#     stays "arm64", as do the marm64/arm64mach symbols and ObjArm64
#     (D-01/D-11 — rename-on-import applies to tree paths, not to the
#     identifiers nm/acid users type).
#
# Wiring edits in this directory (setmach.c, executable.c, obj.c, mkfile)
# follow the donor's own table entries verbatim. The retired port that
# previously occupied letter 7 was excised (D-04/D-05); git history is
# the attic.
#
